body:
Hi {{customer_name}},

Thanks for choosing TripNexio!

We've received your New Visa request for {{country_name}}, but your payment is still pending. Please complete your payment to proceed with the application.

Application ID: {{application_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}

If you have already paid, please disregard this message.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Thanks for choosing TripNexio!

Your New Visa {{country_name}} request has been received. Please complete your payment to proceed.

Application ID: {{application_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}

If you have already paid, please disregard this message.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Thanks for choosing TripNexio! We've received your payment and your New Visa booking is confirmed as received. Your payment invoice is attached to this email.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Visa type/duration: {{visa_type}} / {{visa_duration}}
Passengers: {{passenger_count}}

Our team will review the application and documents and contact you if anything else is required.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Thanks for choosing TripNexio! Your New Visa Payment has been received.
Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Passengers: {{passenger_count}}
We'll update you when there is a next step.

Hi {{customer_name}},

We're waiting for your response to continue your New Visa request.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}

Please open your booking and complete the requested action. If you've already responded, please disregard this reminder.

Hi {{customer_name}}, we're waiting for your response to continue your New Visa request.
Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Please review your booking and respond when you can.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Please upload the required documents to continue your New Visa application.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Passenger: {{passenger_name}}
Following documents are required:
{{required_documents}}

Please upload clear, complete copies.

Use the Upload Documents button below to open the secure upload page.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Please upload the following required documents for your New Visa booking:
Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Passenger: {{passenger_name}}
Please upload: {{required_documents}}

Hi {{customer_name}},

We can't complete the initial document validation because the following documents are missing or need correction

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Passenger and document details:
{{required_documents}}

Please review the notes for each item and upload corrected or missing documents.

Use the Upload / Correct Documents button below to upload the following documents.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The following documents are missing or need correction for your New Visa booking:
Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Passenger: {{passenger_name}}
Please upload/correct: {{required_documents}}

Hi {{customer_name}},

The documents for your New Visa booking have passed our document validation step. This is not a visa approval. We'll continue with the next stage and share an update when available.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}

Hi {{customer_name}},

The {{requesting_authority}} has requested the following additional documents to continue processing your New Visa application.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Passenger and required documents:
{{required_documents}}
Reason/request details: {{additional_document_reason}}

Please submit the listed documents as soon as possible, and follow any deadline shown in your booking.

Use the Submit Additional Documents button below to upload the requested documents.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The embassy/immigration authority has requested the following additional documents for your New Visa application:
Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Passenger: {{passenger_name}}
Required: {{required_documents}}
Reason: {{additional_document_reason}}

Hi {{customer_name}},

We've received the additional documents submitted for your New Visa application. Our team will validate them and continue processing.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Passenger: {{passenger_name}}
Submitted documents:
{{required_documents}}

Hi {{customer_name}},

We've received the additional documents for booking {{booking_id}}.
Country: {{country_name}}
Passenger: {{passenger_name}}
Submitted: {{required_documents}}
Our team will validate them.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Visa approval update for booking {{booking_id}} ({{country_name}}).
Approved passenger(s): {{approved_passenger_names}}
Other outcomes: {{other_passenger_outcomes}}

You can also download available visa files from your TripNexio account.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Good news! Your visa is approved.
Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Passenger(s): {{approved_passenger_names}}

You can also download it from your TripNexio account.
Please verify it against the passport and report any spelling, visa type or other discrepancy within 24 hours. Full travel instructions and disclaimer are in your email.

Hi {{customer_name}},

A visa application has been rejected for the passenger(s) listed below.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Affected passenger(s): {{rejected_passenger_names}}
Reason provided: {{rejection_reason}}

Please contact support if you need assistance.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Visa application decision for booking {{booking_id}} ({{country_name}}).
Rejected passenger(s): {{rejected_passenger_names}}
Reason: {{rejection_reason}}
Please contact TripNexio support if you need assistance.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Your New Visa application is currently on hold.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Reason: {{hold_reason}}
Required next step, if any: {{hold_next_action}}

We'll update you when the next step is confirmed.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Your New Visa application is on hold.
Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Reason: {{hold_reason}}
Next step: {{hold_next_action}}

Hi {{customer_name}},

We've received your request to cancel your New Visa booking. The request is under review; cancellation is not confirmed yet.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Passenger(s) requested for cancellation: {{cancellation_passenger_names}}

If the cancellation is approved, any eligible refund will be processed according to the applicable refund policy and approval.

Hi {{customer_name}},

We've received your cancellation request for booking {{booking_id}}.
Country: {{country_name}}
Passenger(s): {{cancellation_passenger_names}}
Cancellation is under review. If approved, any eligible refund will follow the applicable refund policy and approval.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The cancellation has been confirmed for the passengers listed below. Other passengers may remain active under this booking.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Cancelled passenger(s): {{cancelled_passenger_names}}
Other passenger outcomes: {{other_passenger_outcomes}}

Any eligible refund will be processed according to the applicable refund policy and approval. Refund status will be communicated separately.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Partial cancellation confirmed for booking {{booking_id}}.
Country: {{country_name}}
Cancelled passenger(s): {{cancelled_passenger_names}}
Other outcomes: {{other_passenger_outcomes}}
Any eligible refund is subject to refund policy and approval.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Your New Visa booking has been cancelled.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Cancelled passenger(s): {{cancelled_passenger_names}}

Any eligible refund will be processed according to the applicable refund policy and approval. Refund processing is not confirmed by this cancellation notice.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Your New Visa booking {{booking_id}} has been cancelled.
Country: {{country_name}}
Cancelled passenger(s): {{cancelled_passenger_names}}
Any eligible refund will be processed according to the applicable refund policy and approval.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The refund for your New Visa booking has been confirmed as processed.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Refund ID: {{refund_id}}
Refund amount: {{refund_amount}}
Payment source: Original payment method
Expected posting time: 5–7 working days, depending on your bank/payment provider.
Affected passenger(s), if applicable: {{refund_passenger_names}}

Please keep this email for your records.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Your refund has been processed.
Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Refund ID: {{refund_id}}
Amount: {{refund_amount}}
The amount is expected to reach your original payment source within 5–7 working days, depending on your bank/payment provider.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Thanks for choosing TripNexio!

We've received your Visa Change request and our team will review it.

Application ID: {{application_id}}
Passenger(s): {{passenger_names}}
Visa Change method: {{visa_change_method}}

We'll update you when your quotation is ready.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Your Visa Change quotation is ready.

Application ID: {{application_id}}
Passenger(s): {{passenger_names}}
Method: {{visa_change_method}}
Quotation reference: {{quotation_id}}
Total payable: {{currency}} {{total_amount}}
Package: {{package_summary}}
Eligibility/validity: {{eligibility_and_validity}}

Please review the quotation, applicable charges, validity and refund terms before proceeding.

Hi {{customer_name}},

We've recorded your approval of the Visa Change quotation.

Application ID: {{application_id}}
Quotation reference: {{quotation_id}}
Approved total: {{currency}} {{total_amount}}

Please complete payment using the secure link below. Your booking will be confirmed only after successful payment.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Payment for your Visa Change quotation is still pending.

Application ID: {{application_id}}
Quotation reference: {{quotation_id}}
Amount due: {{currency}} {{total_amount}}

Please complete payment using the secure link below. If you have already paid, please disregard this reminder while we confirm the transaction.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Thanks for choosing TripNexio! Your Visa Change booking is received and payment is confirmed.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Passenger(s): {{passenger_names}}
Method: {{visa_change_method}}
Amount paid: {{currency}} {{amount_paid}}

Your payment invoice is attached. Please follow the document instructions in your TripNexio account.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Following documents are required for your Visa Change booking:

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Passenger(s): {{affected_passenger_names}}
Documents required: {{required_document_list}}

Please upload the listed documents securely. Ensure each file is clear, valid and belongs to the correct passenger.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Following documents are required for your Visa Change booking:

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Passenger(s): {{affected_passenger_names}}
Documents/action required: {{document_issue_list}}

Please upload missing documents or correct rejected documents using the secure link below. Processing may be delayed until the documents are accepted.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The documents for your Visa Change booking have been validated.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Passenger(s): {{passenger_names}}

We'll update you when the next confirmed stage is reached. Document validation does not mean visa approval.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The exit step for your Visa Change booking has been marked as completed.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Passenger(s): {{passenger_names}}
Exit method: {{visa_change_method}}

The next step is preparing your application for submission. We'll notify you when the status changes.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Your Visa Change application has been submitted to the relevant authority/processing channel.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Passenger(s): {{passenger_names}}
Submission date: {{submission_date}}

We'll notify you when there is a verified update. Decisions remain subject to the relevant authorities.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Additional documents have been requested for your Visa Change booking.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Passenger(s): {{affected_passenger_names}}
Requested by: {{requesting_authority}}
Documents required: {{additional_document_list}}
Request details: {{customer_safe_request_reason}}

Please submit the requested documents securely as soon as possible.

Hi {{customer_name}},

We've received the additional documents for your Visa Change booking. They are awaiting review.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Passenger(s): {{affected_passenger_names}}
Documents received: {{submitted_document_list}}

We'll update you when the review is complete.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Good news! Your visa is approved.
Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Country: {{country_name}}
Passenger(s): {{approved_passenger_names}}

You can also download it from your TripNexio account.
Please verify it against the passport and report any spelling, visa type or other discrepancy within 24 hours. Full travel instructions and disclaimer are in your email.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Unfortunately, the visa application for the passenger(s) listed below was rejected by the relevant authority.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Affected passenger(s): {{rejected_passenger_names}}
Reason, if officially shared and safe to disclose: {{customer_safe_rejection_reason}}

Hi {{customer_name}},

Your Visa Change application is temporarily on hold.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Affected passenger(s): {{affected_passenger_names}}
Reason / next step: {{customer_safe_hold_reason}}

Please follow the action requested, if any. We'll update you when the status changes.

Hi {{customer_name}},

We've received your cancellation request. It is under review and is not final until confirmed by TripNexio.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Passenger(s): {{cancellation_passenger_names}}

Any eligible refund is subject to the applicable refund policy and approval.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The cancellation is confirmed for some passengers in your Visa Change booking.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Cancelled passenger(s): {{cancelled_passenger_names}}
Remaining active passenger(s): {{active_passenger_names}}

Any eligible refund is subject to the applicable refund policy and approval. Remaining active services are not cancelled by this update.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The cancellation of your Visa Change booking has been confirmed.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Cancelled passenger(s): {{cancelled_passenger_names}}

Any eligible refund will be handled according to the applicable refund policy and approval process. We'll notify you when the refund status is confirmed.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The refund for your Visa Change booking has been processed.

Booking ID: {{booking_id}}
Refund ID: {{refund_id}}
Refund amount: {{currency}} {{refund_amount}}

The amount is expected to reach your original payment source within 5–7 working days, depending on your bank or payment provider.

Hi {{customer_name}},

We've received your OK to Board (OTB) request.
Booking reference: {{booking_id}}
Passenger(s): {{passenger_names}}
Destination: {{country_name}}
Travel date: {{travel_date}}

Please complete your payment using the Pay Now button below so we can start processing. Receipt of a request does not guarantee airline approval.

Hi {{customer_name}},

We've confirmed your payment for OTB booking {{booking_id}}.
Amount: {{payment_amount}}
Payment reference: {{payment_reference}}
Payment confirmation does not mean OTB approval. Your request proceeds subject to document validation and airline requirements.

Hi {{customer_name}},

We need the following document(s) to continue your OTB request.
Booking reference: {{booking_id}}
Required document(s): {{required_documents}}
Please upload the documents using the button below.

Hi {{customer_name}},

We've received the following document(s): {{document_name}}
Booking reference: {{booking_id}}
The documents still need to be checked. We'll update you when validation is complete.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Your OTB request has been sent to the airline.
Booking reference: {{booking_id}}
Passenger(s): {{passenger_names}}
The airline determines the outcome and response time. We'll share an update when we receive one.

Hi {{customer_name}},

We've received the additional document(s): {{document_name}}
Booking reference: {{booking_id}}
These documents still need validation. We'll update you when the next step is completed.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The airline has approved the OTB request for: {{passenger_names}}
Booking reference: {{booking_id}}
This is an approval status update. TripNexio does not generate a separate OTB approval PDF. Please follow instructions from the airline and airport authorities.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The airline has provided a partial outcome for booking {{booking_id}}.
Approved passenger(s): {{approved_passengers}}
Other passenger(s)/outcome: {{pending_or_rejected_passengers}}
Only passengers explicitly listed as approved have an approved OTB status.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The OTB request for {{passenger_names}} under booking {{booking_id}} was not approved by the airline.
Reason: {{verified_reason}}

Hi {{customer_name}},

We've received your request to partially cancel these passenger(s) in booking {{booking_id}}: {{cancelled_passengers}}
The request is under review and is not final until confirmed in the booking status. Any refund update will be based on confirmed records.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Partial cancellation is confirmed for these passenger(s) in booking {{booking_id}}: {{cancelled_passengers}}
Other passengers are not included in this cancellation. Any applicable refund amount and status will be communicated based on confirmed records.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The refund for OTB booking {{booking_id}} has been completed in our records.
Refund amount: {{refund_amount}}
Refund reference: {{refund_reference}}
Your bank or payment provider may require additional time to reflect the funds.

Hi {{customer_name}},

OTB booking {{booking_id}} has been cancelled and the refund is marked completed.
Refund amount: {{refund_amount}}
Refund reference: {{refund_reference}}
Your bank or payment provider may require additional time to reflect the funds.

Dear {{customer_name}},

We have received your Return Verified Ticket request.
Request ID: {{booking_id}}
Passenger(s): {{passenger_names}}
Destination: {{country_name}}
Travel date: {{travel_date}}

Please complete your payment using the Pay Now button below so we can arrange your ticket.

Dear {{customer_name}},

We have confirmed your payment for Return Verified Ticket request {{booking_id}}.
Amount paid: {{amount_paid}}
Payment reference: {{payment_reference}}

We will proceed with the next step. If any document or information is required, we will contact you.

Dear {{customer_name}},

We are unable to proceed with Return Verified Ticket request {{booking_id}} at this time.
Reason: {{customer_safe_reason}}
Next step: {{next_step}}

If you need assistance, contact {{support_email}}.

Dear {{customer_name}},

A partial cancellation has been confirmed for request {{booking_id}}.
Cancelled passenger(s)/segment(s): {{cancelled_scope}}
Remaining active passenger(s)/segment(s): {{remaining_scope}}
Refund status, if applicable: {{refund_status}}

This update applies only to the items listed above. Please review your booking details.

Dear {{customer_name}},

Cancellation has been confirmed for request {{booking_id}}.
Cancelled passenger(s)/segment(s): {{cancelled_scope}}
Refund status, if applicable: {{refund_status}}

Please note that cancellation and refund are separate outcomes; a refund is not confirmed unless we explicitly mark it completed.

Dear {{customer_name}},

An eligible refund for request {{booking_id}} is being processed.
Refund amount: {{refund_amount}}
Refund reference: {{refund_reference}}

Processing time may depend on the payment provider/bank. We will notify you once completion is confirmed.

Dear {{customer_name}},

We confirm that the refund for request {{booking_id}} has been completed.
Refund amount: {{refund_amount}}
Refund reference: {{refund_reference}}

Your bank or payment provider may require additional time to reflect the amount in your account.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Your special fare quotation is ready.
Route: {{origin}} → {{destination}} | Date: {{travel_date}}
Itinerary: {{itinerary_summary}}
Total: {{currency}} {{quoted_amount}}
Valid until: {{quote_expiry_time}}
Fare is subject to final availability. Payment must be completed before expiry; payment does not confirm ticket issuance.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Your special fare quotation is ready.
Route: {{origin}} → {{destination}} | Date: {{travel_date}}
Itinerary: {{itinerary_summary}}
Total: {{currency}} {{quoted_amount}}
Valid until: {{quote_expiry_time}}
Fare is subject to final availability. Payment must be completed before expiry; payment does not confirm ticket issuance.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Documents required for {{booking_id}}:
{{missing_documents_list}}
Passengers: {{passengers_requiring_documents}}
Please upload clear, valid copies.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Documents required for {{booking_id}}:
{{missing_documents_list}}
Passengers: {{passengers_requiring_documents}}
Please upload clear, valid copies.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The requested flight is unavailable.
Requested: {{requested_origin}} → {{requested_destination}}
Alternative: {{alternative_origin}} → {{alternative_destination}}
Itinerary: {{alternative_itinerary}}
Fare: {{currency}} {{alternative_amount}} | Difference: {{currency}} {{fare_difference}}
Please review route and itinerary. Not confirmed until accepted and any required payment is complete.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The requested flight is unavailable.
Requested: {{requested_origin}} → {{requested_destination}}
Alternative: {{alternative_origin}} → {{alternative_destination}}
Itinerary: {{alternative_itinerary}}
Fare: {{currency}} {{alternative_amount}} | Difference: {{currency}} {{fare_difference}}
Please review route and itinerary. Not confirmed until accepted and any required payment is complete.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Cancellation quotation for {{booking_id}}:
Cancellation charges: {{currency}} {{cancellation_charges}}
Estimated refund: {{currency}} {{estimated_refund}}
Valid until: {{cancellation_quote_expiry}}
Please review. Cancellation proceeds only after your approval and remains subject to airline rules.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Cancellation quotation for {{booking_id}}:
Cancellation charges: {{currency}} {{cancellation_charges}}
Estimated refund: {{currency}} {{estimated_refund}}
Valid until: {{cancellation_quote_expiry}}
Please review. Cancellation proceeds only after your approval and remains subject to airline rules.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The airline has confirmed cancellation of booking {{booking_id}}.
Passengers/segments: {{cancellation_scope}}
Estimated refund: {{currency}} {{estimated_refund}}
We'll update you as the refund progresses.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The airline has confirmed cancellation of booking {{booking_id}}.
Passengers/segments: {{cancellation_scope}}
Estimated refund: {{currency}} {{estimated_refund}}
We'll update you as the refund progresses.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Refund for booking {{booking_id}} is being processed.
Amount: {{currency}} {{refund_amount}}
Reference: {{refund_reference}}
Your bank/payment provider may need additional time to post it.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Refund for booking {{booking_id}} is being processed.
Amount: {{currency}} {{refund_amount}}
Reference: {{refund_reference}}
Your bank/payment provider may need additional time to post it.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Refund for booking {{booking_id}} has been completed from our side.
Amount: {{currency}} {{refund_amount}}
Reference: {{refund_reference}}
Please allow your bank/payment provider its usual processing time.

Hi {{customer_name}},

Refund for booking {{booking_id}} has been completed from our side.
Amount: {{currency}} {{refund_amount}}
Reference: {{refund_reference}}
Please allow your bank/payment provider its usual processing time.

Hi {{customer_name}},

The airline has confirmed that booking {{booking_id}} has been cancelled.
Passengers/segments: {{cancellation_scope}}
Estimated refund: {{currency}} {{estimated_refund}}
We'll update you when the refund progresses.
